[{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0009:b006:l019","ordinal":185857,"en":"Than Manas, I heard."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0009:b006:l020","ordinal":185858,"en":"He is no son who will stand and watch,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0009:b006:l021","ordinal":185859,"en":"No slave who will refrain from grappling."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0009:b006:l022","ordinal":185860,"en":"You were a hero, Karagul;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0009:b006:l023","ordinal":185861,"en":"Be wary of this side!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0009:b006:l024","ordinal":185862,"en":"When we fought in those days,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0009:b006:l025","ordinal":185863,"en":"There was one called Bakai;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0009:b006:l026","ordinal":185864,"en":"He was the finest man of all."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0009:b006:l027","ordinal":185865,"en":"He was highly skilled among spearmen,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0009:b006:l028","ordinal":185866,"en":"And was foremost at reading"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0009:b006:l029","ordinal":185867,"en":"The stratagems of the enemy."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0009:b006:l030","ordinal":185868,"en":"He was a lion quick with a sword,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0009:b006:l031","ordinal":185869,"en":"A hero who was a marksman with a gun."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0009:b006:l032","ordinal":185870,"en":"Girded at his narrow waist,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0009:b006:l033","ordinal":185871,"en":"He attacked Beijing alone,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0009:b006:l034","ordinal":185872,"en":"That city too vast for the earth to bear."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0009:b006:l035","ordinal":185873,"en":"His eyes blazed like a lion’s;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0009:b006:l036","ordinal":185874,"en":"He regarded death as less than a hair"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0009:b006:l037","ordinal":185875,"en":"And carried Manas’s golden banner."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0009:b006:l038","ordinal":185876,"en":"If a hero was speared, who speared him?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0009:b006:l039","ordinal":185877,"en":"As I recall, hero Bakai speared him—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b003:l001","ordinal":185878,"en":"His fame remained beside Manas."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b003:l002","ordinal":185879,"en":"Wise and ingenious in stratagems,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b003:l003","ordinal":185880,"en":"Lion Bakai was a hero;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b003:l004","ordinal":185881,"en":"In wisdom and cunning"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b003:l005","ordinal":185882,"en":"He was no less than Manas."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b003:l006","ordinal":185883,"en":"When he battled with us,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b003:l007","ordinal":185884,"en":"Bakai’s beard was mottled gray."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b003:l008","ordinal":185885,"en":"That Bakai must have died,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b003:l009","ordinal":185886,"en":"Must have beheld the face of Judgment Day."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b003:l010","ordinal":185887,"en":"If that Bakai has not died,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b003:l011","ordinal":185888,"en":"If he has not beheld the face of Judgment Day,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b003:l012","ordinal":185889,"en":"He would lead Semetey"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b003:l013","ordinal":185890,"en":"And bring him here."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b003:l014","ordinal":185891,"en":"The reason he would bring him is this:"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b003:l015","ordinal":185892,"en":"Was it not Bakai"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b003:l016","ordinal":185893,"en":"Who brought chaos upon the Kakanchin?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b003:l017","ordinal":185894,"en":"Was it not Bakai"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b003:l018","ordinal":185895,"en":"Who seized the khanate of Chet-Beijing?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b003:l019","ordinal":185896,"en":"Was it not Bakai who mounted"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b003:l020","ordinal":185897,"en":"The golden throne where the khan sits?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b003:l021","ordinal":185898,"en":"Was it not Bakai"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b003:l022","ordinal":185899,"en":"Who journeyed through Beijing on many campaigns?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b003:l023","ordinal":185900,"en":"The roads to Beijing have five branches—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b003:l024","ordinal":185901,"en":"Distinct as the five fingers of his hand—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b003:l025","ordinal":185902,"en":"Was it not Bakai who knew them?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b003:l026","ordinal":185903,"en":"Was it not Bakai who led campaigns"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b003:l027","ordinal":185904,"en":"Against the Kakan and traveled"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b003:l028","ordinal":185905,"en":"Through this land many times?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b003:l029","ordinal":185906,"en":"That Bakai will not disappear;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b003:l030","ordinal":185907,"en":"While that Bakai does not disappear,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b003:l031","ordinal":185908,"en":"Affairs in Beijing will not prosper."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b003:l032","ordinal":185909,"en":"Bakai, the infidel of the Burut—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b003:l033","ordinal":185910,"en":"Karagul, you are no less"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b003:l034","ordinal":185911,"en":"Than that Khan Bakai in cunning!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b003:l035","ordinal":185912,"en":"He joined what had been severed"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b003:l036","ordinal":185913,"en":"And gathered what had been scattered"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b003:l037","ordinal":185914,"en":"By that bastard Bloodthirsty One."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b003:l038","ordinal":185915,"en":"With that Bakai leading the way,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b003:l039","ordinal":185916,"en":"If it pleases the sly Burut,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b004:l001","ordinal":185917,"en":"May he not come here on patrol!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b004:l002","ordinal":185918,"en":"You have your superb Black Horse;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b004:l003","ordinal":185919,"en":"Were it not for your old age,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b004:l004","ordinal":185920,"en":"You would be a mighty and renowned man!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b004:l005","ordinal":185921,"en":"Keep watch from Altyn-Ken over there;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b004:l006","ordinal":185922,"en":"Sleep was never your kin,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b004:l007","ordinal":185923,"en":"And lying asleep never brought good."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b004:l008","ordinal":185924,"en":"Seek news from Kuukulzha."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b004:l009","ordinal":185925,"en":"Why should I remain here now?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b004:l010","ordinal":185926,"en":"I will add the bereft Algara"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b004:l011","ordinal":185927,"en":"To the black-cloud herd"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b004:l012","ordinal":185928,"en":"So that he may grow stout,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b004:l013","ordinal":185929,"en":"Then leave him behind."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b004:l014","ordinal":185930,"en":"If you are caught unawares, disaster will follow;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b004:l015","ordinal":185931,"en":"May you perish together with your herd—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b004:l016","ordinal":185932,"en":"Algara is entrusted to you!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b004:l017","ordinal":185933,"en":"Why should I remain here heedlessly?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b004:l018","ordinal":185934,"en":"I will depart toward Beijing."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b004:l019","ordinal":185935,"en":"This year the people of forty khans have gathered;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b004:l020","ordinal":185936,"en":"They are opening Chagaan and holding a feast."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b004:l021","ordinal":185937,"en":"Now that my mustache is turning gray,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b004:l022","ordinal":185938,"en":"I have not had the least fill of pleasure."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b004:l023","ordinal":185939,"en":"Six teitei and forty shurkut—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b004:l024","ordinal":185940,"en":"Those are the wives I took;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b004:l025","ordinal":185941,"en":"I will sport with them."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b004:l026","ordinal":185942,"en":"I am hero Kongurbai;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b004:l027","ordinal":185943,"en":"My valor stands apart from the people,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b004:l028","ordinal":185944,"en":"And I am the protecting fortress of Beijing."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b004:l029","ordinal":185945,"en":"With the six teitei and forty shurkut,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b004:l030","ordinal":185946,"en":"Lying a few days in their embrace,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b004:l031","ordinal":185947,"en":"This is the time to take my pleasure."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b004:l032","ordinal":185948,"en":"Why should I give more counsel now?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b004:l033","ordinal":185949,"en":"You are yourself an exceptional man;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b004:l034","ordinal":185950,"en":"I will depart toward the Kakan."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b004:l035","ordinal":185951,"en":"If I keep watch, I am myself a great noble;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b004:l036","ordinal":185952,"en":"I roam through Beijing."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b004:l037","ordinal":185953,"en":"My renown is that of a peerless great noble;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b004:l038","ordinal":185954,"en":"I roam through the Kakan."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0010:b004:l039","ordinal":185955,"en":"Traveling often between the two,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b003:l001","ordinal":185956,"en":"While trying to protect my people,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b003:l002","ordinal":185957,"en":"Patrolling a lot,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b003:l003","ordinal":185958,"en":"While trying to save the mother,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b003:l004","ordinal":185959,"en":"I was not interested at all."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b003:l005","ordinal":185960,"en":"I was not playing"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b003:l006","ordinal":185961,"en":"Think about it, Caragul!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b003:l007","ordinal":185962,"en":"Keep your guard up"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b003:l008","ordinal":185963,"en":"Do not heal those who do not hold,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b003:l009","ordinal":185964,"en":"Hold the head and shake it."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b003:l010","ordinal":185965,"en":"Look at the amount collected at customs,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b003:l011","ordinal":185966,"en":"Treasure trove"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b003:l012","ordinal":185967,"en":"Take care, take good care!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b003:l013","ordinal":185968,"en":"Your father's grave, Karagul,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b003:l014","ordinal":185969,"en":"Did you see what I saw?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b003:l015","ordinal":185970,"en":"The mechanism rattled in the black juniper"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b003:l016","ordinal":185971,"en":"What kind of child was it?!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b003:l017","ordinal":185972,"en":"White hardy juniper"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b003:l018","ordinal":185973,"en":"It doesn't look like a charm."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b003:l019","ordinal":185974,"en":"Comments are on the back"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b003:l020","ordinal":185975,"en":"My road is as big as a house"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b003:l021","ordinal":185976,"en":"This will happen now?!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b003:l022","ordinal":185977,"en":"He said without calling,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b003:l023","ordinal":185978,"en":"What Karagul looked at,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b003:l024","ordinal":185979,"en":"Olondogan is a slave"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b003:l025","ordinal":185980,"en":"He was able to relax."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b003:l026","ordinal":185981,"en":"Or not knowing the meaning,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b003:l027","ordinal":185982,"en":"Or not knowing if it's a joke,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b003:l028","ordinal":185983,"en":"The wayward Karagul,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b003:l029","ordinal":185984,"en":"This is what happened."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b003:l030","ordinal":185985,"en":"Look wild child,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b003:l031","ordinal":185986,"en":"A fire burns in the belly,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b003:l032","ordinal":185987,"en":"This is unbearable"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b003:l033","ordinal":185988,"en":"Relax and pretend"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b003:l034","ordinal":185989,"en":"Unable to sit, shocked."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b003:l035","ordinal":185990,"en":"\"A flat stone without a soul.\""},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b003:l036","ordinal":185991,"en":"It doesn't seem to be closed."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b003:l037","ordinal":185992,"en":"Where is your soul?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b003:l038","ordinal":185993,"en":"Black juniper that does not climb"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b003:l039","ordinal":185994,"en":"It doesn't look like a mountain.\""},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b005:l001","ordinal":185995,"en":"Think about it."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b005:l002","ordinal":185996,"en":"Can not sit here!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b005:l003","ordinal":185997,"en":"Like a blue horse,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b005:l004","ordinal":185998,"en":"The Karagul that comes to your eyes"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b005:l005","ordinal":185999,"en":"Looked a lot and mourned."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b005:l006","ordinal":186000,"en":"Konurbai and Karagul"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b005:l007","ordinal":186001,"en":"Looked at this a lot."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b005:l008","ordinal":186002,"en":"Frowning,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b005:l009","ordinal":186003,"en":"He looked a lot."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b005:l010","ordinal":186004,"en":"That the slave was suspicious"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b005:l011","ordinal":186005,"en":"Kurgan boy now knows."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b005:l012","ordinal":186006,"en":"Black fur like a boiler"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b005:l013","ordinal":186007,"en":"Tore it from his head,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b005:l014","ordinal":186008,"en":"Hiding the dark side,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b005:l015","ordinal":186009,"en":"Exceeding the scope"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b005:l016","ordinal":186010,"en":"Like the head"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b005:l017","ordinal":186011,"en":"Throwing up."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b005:l018","ordinal":186012,"en":"Round and round"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b005:l019","ordinal":186013,"en":"Tebetei came to earth now,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b005:l020","ordinal":186014,"en":"Now the slave saw the snow,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b005:l021","ordinal":186015,"en":"\"The horse died in the ditch,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b005:l022","ordinal":186016,"en":"He saw a description of the beast."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b005:l023","ordinal":186017,"en":"The stalled horse died."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b005:l024","ordinal":186018,"en":"He ate the horse."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b005:l025","ordinal":186019,"en":"I asked if he was a guard."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b005:l026","ordinal":186020,"en":"Is there a black comment?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b005:l027","ordinal":186021,"en":"Pouring the juice,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b005:l028","ordinal":186022,"en":"Riding on a blue horse,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b005:l029","ordinal":186023,"en":"If you can see it"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b005:l030","ordinal":186024,"en":"Caught like a blue tiger,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b005:l031","ordinal":186025,"en":"Leather strap, twist waist"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b005:l032","ordinal":186026,"en":"Kalcha, a buruksugan man."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0011:b005:l033","ordinal":186027,"en":"Cotton belt, wide boots,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013